<!doctype html><html class="motion-safe:scroll-smooth" lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="description" content="A cozy café on the corner of Oak Street and Elm Avenue, pouring coffee and baking sourdough since six every morning." /><title>Oats &amp; Ends Café</title><link href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>☕</text></svg>" rel="icon" /><link href="/static/oats_and_ends.69f448a559b18f0d.css" rel="stylesheet" /></head><body class="min-h-screen font-sans"><a class="btn btn-neutral btn-sm sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:top-4 focus:left-4 z-50" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="sticky top-0 z-20 bg-base-100 border-b border-base-300"><div class="navbar container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl"><div class="navbar-start"><a class="text-xl font-bold font-serif" href="/">Oats &amp; Ends</a></div><div class="navbar-end gap-6"><nav class="flex items-center gap-6" aria-label="Primary"><a class="link link-hover font-medium" href="#menu">Menu</a><a class="link link-hover font-medium" href="#hours">Hours</a><a class="link link-hover font-medium" href="#visit">Visit</a></nav><a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="#newsletter">Newsletter</a></div></div></header><section class="hero py-16 container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl text-center"><div class="hero-content flex-col"><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-balance">Freshly roasted, freshly baked</h1><p class="text-lg text-base-content/80">We open at six and pour until the last regular leaves. Come for the coffee, stay for the toast.</p><div class="flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap mt-6"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#menu">See the menu</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#visit">Get directions</a></div></div></section><main class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl space-y-12 pb-16" id="main" tabindex="-1"><article id="about"><h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-3">Our story</h2><p>Oats &amp; Ends opened on Oak Street, at the corner of Elm Avenue, bringing new aromas to the block. Its cozy atmosphere draws in passersby looking to treat themselves to a cup or two of good, hot black coffee and a slice of something fresh from the oven.</p></article><section id="menu" aria-labelledby="menu-heading"><h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold" id="menu-heading">On the menu</h2><p class="text-lg text-base-content/80">Small menu, made in-house, changed with the seasons.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-8"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold border-b border-base-300 pb-2 mb-4">Coffee</h3><ul class="list" role="list"><li class="list-row flex-wrap items-baseline gap-y-1"><div class="list-col-grow font-semibold">Black coffee</div><div class="text-sm text-base-content/70 list-col-wrap w-full">Drip-brewed, roasted twenty minutes down the road.</div></li><li class="list-row flex-wrap items-baseline gap-y-1"><div class="list-col-grow font-semibold">Hot chocolate</div><div class="text-sm text-base-content/70 list-col-wrap w-full">Steamed whole milk, dark cocoa, no shortcuts.</div></li><li class="list-row flex-wrap items-baseline gap-y-1"><div class="list-col-grow font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">Oat milk latte<div class="tooltip tooltip-top" data-tip="Dairy-free. Works in any espresso drink, just ask."><button class="btn btn-circle btn-xs btn-outline" type="button" aria-label="Oat milk information">i</button></div></div><div class="text-sm text-base-content/70 list-col-wrap w-full">Double shot, steamed oat milk.</div></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold border-b border-base-300 pb-2 mb-4">From the oven</h3><ul class="list" role="list"><li class="list-row flex-wrap items-baseline gap-y-1"><div class="list-col-grow font-semibold">Rustic toast</div><div class="text-sm text-base-content/70 list-col-wrap w-full">Thick-cut, butter and jam on the side.</div></li><li class="list-row flex-wrap items-baseline gap-y-1"><div class="list-col-grow font-semibold">Morning bun</div><div class="text-sm text-base-content/70 list-col-wrap w-full">Laminated dough, cinnamon sugar crust.</div></li><li class="list-row flex-wrap items-baseline gap-y-1"><div class="list-col-grow font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">Sourdough loaf<div class="tooltip tooltip-top" data-tip="Baked fresh each morning, ask what's left."><button class="btn btn-circle btn-xs btn-outline" type="button" aria-label="Sourdough information">i</button></div></div><div class="text-sm text-base-content/70 list-col-wrap w-full">Whole loaf, ready to take home.</div></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="hours" aria-labelledby="hours-heading"><h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4" id="hours-heading">Hours</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto max-w-md"><table class="table"><caption class="text-left font-semibold mb-2">Opening hours</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Day</th><th scope="col">Hours</th></tr></thead><tbody class="tabular-nums"><tr><th scope="row">Weekdays</th><td>6:00 – 18:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Weekends</th><td>7:00 – 16:00</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 mt-3">Holidays are a coin toss. Email us before making a special trip.</p></section><section id="visit" aria-labelledby="visit-heading"><h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-3" id="visit-heading">Visit</h2><address class="not-italic leading-relaxed">Oak Street, corner of Elm Avenue<br /><a class="link link-primary" href="mailto:hello@oatsandends.test">hello@oatsandends.test</a></address><p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 mt-2">No reservations. If there's a free chair, it's yours.</p><div class="mt-4"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:hello@oatsandends.test">Email us</a></div></section><section id="newsletter" aria-labelledby="newsletter-heading"><h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold" id="newsletter-heading">Stay in the loop</h2><p class="text-lg text-base-content/80">New seasonal drinks, bread restocks, and the occasional live music night, straight to your inbox.</p><form class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-4 mt-6" action="/newsletter" method="post"><fieldset class="fieldset"><legend class="fieldset-legend font-medium">Email</legend><input class="input min-w-64" id="email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required /></fieldset><button class="btn btn-primary">Sign me up</button></form><p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 mt-3">Just bread news and the odd event, never more than twice a month.</p></section></main><footer class="footer sm:footer-horizontal border-t border-base-300 py-8 bg-base-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl flex justify-between items-center flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm"><small>&copy; 2026 Oats &amp; Ends Café</small><address class="not-italic">Oak Street, corner of Elm Avenue</address></div></footer></body></html>
